      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still wishing for this, somewhere the uploader can check on the website or ingame that tracks the # of favs for an avi and perhaps has a 'heat meter' to show if the avi is actively being used by more or less people relative to the previous check. If it'd be a burden on the servers to track in real time, maybe only check once daily or weekly etc - heck, make it a VRC+ feature if that'd help justify the resources. Having a way to see which of my public avatars are the most liked/used would be super helpful when it comes to maintaining and updating them, would give me feedback on what people like so I can create better content for the platform, and it'd also just be very gratifying to see.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
