      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please 🙏 \n\nI was directed to the canny to check for this, and found this post. \n\nCreators dont have much insight into if a model is liked or not, outside of maybe 3rd party sale sites and friends sending avatars they see in the wild. (I cant say thats accurate either.)\n\nI want to know which models are most popular so I can bring those features into other avatars. It would also help in knowing which avatars should have priority when updating, or creating new things for them. (It would also help me know what people DONT want.) \n\nThanks for reading!",
